# New pages and language switching

Every new page must integrate the site's shared top-right Chinese/English switch and persisted language preference. Use the existing shared header and locale mechanisms; do not create an independent switch. Translate page content and relevant accessible labels in both languages, including dynamically added content, and verify switching, persistence, and navigation on desktop and mobile.
